<title>HONG KONG: Fu Hui Jewellery names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Fu Hui Jewellery names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fu Hui Jewellery Co (H.K.) Ltd said it has appointed executive director So Sik as chairman of the company with effect from February 27, replacing Lin Xiang Chao who resigned as chairman with effect from the same date.</p>
<p>The jewellery maker also said it has appointed Wang Min Hua as vice chairman, Ng Wai Huen as managing director, Wu Jian Rong and So Kim Fung as deputy managing directors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
